    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36107" root="قلح" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْحٌ</span></b>  An ass [app. a wild ass] <i>advanced in
age:</i> (K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْخٌ</span>. (Lth and K in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قلخ</span>.) [See art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قلخ</span> for two other significations
mentioned in this art. (one of them inexactly) by
Golius and Freytag.]

